         FIG. 6  is a view illustrating an example of a procedure for an application server t transmit non-IP data to a UE; 
         FIG. 7  is a view illustrating a method for transferring a group message using a multimedia broadcast multicast service (MBMS); 
         FIG. 8  is a view illustrating an example of another method for transferring a group message using a MBMS; 
