     By looking to the received SCS/AS reference ID, the SCEF  602  may identify which MME/SGSN/C-SGN data is to be sent and which UE the data is sent to and discover the SCEF reference ID or IMSI corresponding thereto ( 612 ). If the SCS/AS  604  has not been permitted to perform SDT as per the mobile communication service provider&#39;s policy or if the frequency at which the SCS/AS may transmit exceeds, the SCEF may perform step  620  to reject the SDT request. 
