     In  FIG. 8 , if a TMS allocation has already been performed and is still valid, steps  810  to  818  may be omitted. Further, if a MBMS bearer has been activated without TMGI allocation, steps  810  to  818  may be omitted. The TMGI is an identifier for a group receiving MBMS traffic, and the UE may receive MBMS traffic for an allocated TMGI. 
