     4. The HSS  920  may inspect the request to determine whether the ID (External ID or MSISDN) of the corresponding UE is included and the included parameters are acceptable by the mobile communication operator. The HSS  920  may check an ID for billing to accept the request. If the request is rejected, a rejection message with a cause is transmitted to the SCEF  930 . 
