     The IMSI and MME/SGSN/C-SGN Routing Information may be transmitted only in the case of using the IWK-SCEF  910  and/or of SDT (or there is any task for information transmission via any other SCS/AS and/or SCEF). The IWK-SCEF  910  may perform downlink data transmission using the IMSI and MME/SGSN/C-SGN Routing Information. The MME/SGSN/C-SGN may transmit the IMSI(s) received at step 5. The MME/SGSN/C-SGN Routing Information is the information on a core network entity serving the UE identified by each IMSI. The IWK-SCEF maps the IMSI, Routing Information, and SCEF Reference ID and stores the mapping. 
