       FIG. 35  is a diagram illustrating a method for an MCPTT UE  3500  to notify the EPS network of its MCPTT capability in attaching to the EPS network, a method for notifying the MME  3520  of the cause of attaching for use of the MCPTT service, and a method and procedure for establishing a bearer for the MCPTT service according to an embodiment of the present invention. 
